---
title: "HSCI Student Wellness Center"
subtitle: "Support for body, mind and spirit, offered by the Hindu Spiritual Care Institute"
layout: base.njk
permalink: /wellness/
seoTitle: "HSCI Student Wellness Center | CHSA"
seoDescription: "Yoga and meditation, expert videos on the Bhagavad Gita, exam anxiety, stress and relationships, and private conversations with HSCI chaplains and counselors."
---
{# Links and topics come from site.wellness in src/_data/site.js. #}
{% set w = site.wellness %}
<div class="container">

  <section class="page-hero">
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">{{ subtitle }}</p>
  </section>

  <div class="wellness-intro">
    <div class="wellness-qr">
      {% qr w.url, w.name %}
      <p>Scan to open the Wellness Center</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>REPLACE (optional): a sentence on the relationship between CHSA and HSCI, and who the Wellness Center is for.</p>
      <a href="{{ w.url }}" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit the Wellness Center →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card-grid wellness-grid">
    <a class="card card-link" href="{{ w.yogaUrl or w.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <h3>Yoga &amp; Meditation Center</h3>
      <p>Guided yoga and meditation practice for calm and focus.</p>
      <span class="card-go">Open →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="card card-link" href="{{ w.videosUrl or w.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <h3>Expert videos</h3>
      <p>Short talks from experts on topics students ask about:</p>
      <ul class="topic-list">
        {% for t in w.videoTopics %}<li>{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}
        <li>…and more</li>
      </ul>
      <span class="card-go">Watch →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="card card-link" href="{{ w.conversationUrl or w.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <h3>Private conversation</h3>
      <p>Talk one-to-one, in confidence, with an HSCI chaplain or counselor.</p>
      <span class="card-go">Reach out →</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <p class="safety-note">If you are in crisis, call or text <strong>988</strong> (Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline), or call 911 in an emergency.</p>

</div>
